# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored: never commit the token.
#
# Make a token in Canvas: Account -> Settings -> Approved Integrations
# -> "+ New Access Token". Give it a purpose ("course conversion") and an
# expiry date. It has every permission your account has, so treat it like a
# password, and revoke it from the same page if it ever leaks.
CANVAS_TOKEN=
